+        <details class="faq-item"><summary>Will rain ruin my Sydney port day?</summary><p>Sydney's compact CBD keeps indoor refuges close — the Museum of Contemporary Art (free entry), the Sydney Aquarium, the Powerhouse Museum, the Queen Victoria Building's covered shopping arcade, and the Opera House's interior tours all stay accessible. The Manly Ferry runs in light rain (and the moody harbor light is photogenic). Bondi and the coastal track lose appeal in heavy rain. The live weather widget in the seasonal panel above is the primary source for short-term forecasts on a specific sailing date.</p></details>
       </details>
